---
/**
 * Prompting as clear communication: vague ask → Goal → Context → Constraints → Format.
 * One composition; sequential reveal (not bouncing bars).
 */
---

<figure class="diagram diagram--anim">
  <figcaption class="diagram__caption">
    <span class="mono-label">Animation</span>
    From a vague ask to a clear brief — four parts, one idea at a time
  </figcaption>
  <div class="diagram__frame">
    <svg
      class="diagram__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 360"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="prompt-title prompt-desc"
    >
      <title id="prompt-title">Building a clear prompt</title>
      <desc id="prompt-desc">
        A vague request, help with my resume, transforms into a clear brief with four parts: Goal,
        Context, Constraints, and Format. Each part appears in order with a short example line.
      </desc>

      <rect x="12" y="12" width="616" height="336" rx="4" fill="var(--surface-quiet)" stroke="var(--rule)" />

      <!-- Vague ask -->
      <g class="ps-vague">
        <text class="diagram-hint" x="36" y="42" fill="var(--ink)" style="letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 10px;">
          Vague
        </text>
        <rect x="36" y="52" width="220" height="44" rx="3" fill="var(--mist-soft)" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1.25" />
        <text x="52" y="80" fill="var(--ink)" fill-opacity="0.55" style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15px; font-style: italic;">
          “help with my resume”
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow vague → clear -->
      <path
        class="ps-bridge"
        d="M270 74 H318"
        fill="none"
        stroke="var(--brand)"
        stroke-width="1.75"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        marker-end="url(#ps-arrow)"
      />
      <text class="diagram-hint" x="294" y="64" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--brand)">brief</text>

      <!-- Clear brief panel -->
      <text class="diagram-hint" x="340" y="42" fill="var(--brand)" style="letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 10px;">
        Clear brief
      </text>
      <rect x="340" y="52" width="268" height="44" rx="3" fill="var(--teal-soft)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-opacity="0.45" />
      <text x="356" y="80" fill="var(--ink)" style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 14px;">
        Same ask — four clear parts
      </text>

      <!-- Step cards -->
      <g class="ps-step ps-step--1">
        <rect x="36" y="120" width="568" height="48" rx="3" fill="var(--teal-soft)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.75" />
        <circle cx="64" cy="144" r="14" fill="var(--surface-quiet)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="64" y="149" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--brand)" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;">1</text>
        <text x="92" y="138" fill="var(--ink)" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">Goal</text>
        <text x="92" y="158" fill="var(--ink)" fill-opacity="0.75" style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 13px;">
          Draft a 3-bullet summary for a hiring manager
        </text>
      </g>

      <g class="ps-step ps-step--2">
        <rect x="36" y="180" width="568" height="48" rx="3" fill="var(--cobalt-soft)" stroke="var(--action)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-opacity="0.55" />
        <circle cx="64" cy="204" r="14" fill="var(--surface-quiet)" stroke="var(--action)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
        <text x="64" y="209" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--action)" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;">2</text>
        <text x="92" y="198" fill="var(--ink)" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">Context</text>
        <text x="92" y="218" fill="var(--ink)" fill-opacity="0.75" style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 13px;">
          Career switcher · pasting bullet notes below
        </text>
      </g>

      <g class="ps-step ps-step--3">
        <rect x="36" y="240" width="568" height="48" rx="3" fill="var(--teal-soft)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <circle cx="64" cy="264" r="14" fill="var(--surface-quiet)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="64" y="269" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--brand)" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;">3</text>
        <text x="92" y="258" fill="var(--ink)" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">Constraints</text>
        <text x="92" y="278" fill="var(--ink)" fill-opacity="0.75" style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 13px;">
          Under 80 words · plain language · no fluff
        </text>
      </g>

      <g class="ps-step ps-step--4">
        <rect x="36" y="300" width="568" height="36" rx="3" fill="var(--mist-deep)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-opacity="0.45" />
        <circle cx="64" cy="318" r="12" fill="var(--surface-quiet)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-opacity="0.5" />
        <text x="64" y="322" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;">4</text>
        <text x="92" y="314" fill="var(--ink)" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">Format</text>
        <text x="168" y="314" fill="var(--ink)" fill-opacity="0.75" style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 13px;">
          Bullets only · no intro paragraph
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- highlight traveler down the steps -->
      <rect class="ps-cursor" x="28" y="120" width="4" height="48" rx="2" fill="var(--action)" />

      <defs>
        <marker id="ps-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0,0 L6,3 L0,6" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.25" />
        </marker>
      </defs>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <p class="diagram__legend">
    Clarity beats cleverness: say the job, give context, set limits, ask for a shape.
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .ps-step {
    opacity: 0.28;
    animation: ps-reveal 10s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .ps-step--1 {
    animation-delay: 0s;
  }
  .ps-step--2 {
    animation-delay: 2.2s;
  }
  .ps-step--3 {
    animation-delay: 4.4s;
  }
  .ps-step--4 {
    animation-delay: 6.6s;
  }

  .ps-cursor {
    animation: ps-cursor 10s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .ps-vague {
    animation: ps-vague 10s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .ps-bridge {
    stroke-dasharray: 4 6;
    animation: ps-bridge 10s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ps-reveal {
    0%,
    8% {
      opacity: 0.28;
    }
    14%,
    88% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    96%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0.28;
    }
  }

  @keyframes ps-cursor {
    0%,
    10% {
      transform: translateY(0);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    25%,
    32% {
      transform: translateY(60px);
    }
    45%,
    52% {
      transform: translateY(120px);
    }
    65%,
    78% {
      transform: translateY(180px);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    90%,
    100% {
      transform: translateY(180px);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  @keyframes ps-vague {
    0%,
    12% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    30%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0.55;
    }
  }

  @keyframes ps-bridge {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: -40;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ps-step,
    .ps-cursor,
    .ps-vague,
    .ps-bridge {
      animation: none !important;
    }
    .ps-step {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    .ps-cursor {
      display: none;
    }
    .ps-bridge {
      stroke-dasharray: none;
    }
    .ps-vague {
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
  }
</style>
